  "kind": "tool",
  "description": "Search cloud audit logs, generate forensic timelines, and apply Sigma-based detections.",
  "about": "Suzaku brings Hayabusa's timeline-and-detection workflow to exported cloud logs. The current release searches and summarizes AWS CloudTrail data, produces CloudTrail metrics and DFIR timelines, and builds Azure timelines, applying its bundled Sigma rules to surface matching activity. It works on log files supplied locally; it does not connect to or modify a cloud account.",
